[3524.237452, "o", "\r\n\r\n▄▄ ▄▄\r\n██ ██\r\n██ ██  ▀▀█▄ ███▄███▄  ▀▀█▄    ▄████ ████▄ ████▄\r\n██ ██ ▄█▀██ ██ ██ ██ ▄█▀██    ██    ██ ██ ██ ██\r\n██ ██ ▀█▄██ ██ ██ ██ ▀█▄██ ██ ▀████ ████▀ ████▀\r\n                                    ██    ██\r\n                                    ▀▀    ▀▀\r\n\r\nbuild      : b12033-785322d17\r\nmodel      : unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF:UD-Q2_K_XL\r\nftype      : Q2_K - Medium\r\nmodalities : text\r\n\r\navailable commands:\r\n  /exit or Ctrl+C     stop or exit\r\n  /regen              regenerate the last response\r\n  /clear              clear the chat history\r\n  /read <file>        add a text file\r\n  /glob <pattern>     add text files using globbing pattern\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n> Write a Python function merge_intervals(intervals) that takes a list of [start, end] pairs and returns them merged so that none overlap, sorted by start. Reply with only the code.\r\n"]
